    "description": "<p>Your morph has &ldquo;bush robot&rdquo; digits that are capable of splitting into smaller digits, and those smaller digits into micro digits, and so on down to the nanometer scale. These fingers can operate independently, allowing for ultra-fine manipulation. When coupled with nanoscopic vision, this even allows you to manipulate individual nanobots. Apply a +10 modifier to Hardware Tests where micro- or nano-manipulation is an important factor. The cybernetic version of this mod can only be applied to cyberlimbs.</p>",
